This license applies to the contents of the `data/` directory (anonymized/
derived HPC job trace data, e.g. the `allusers-*-30.log`,
`jobs_default_cleaned.txt`, and `durations_*.txt` files, derived from
internal production Slurm logs at GSI/FAIR), and does not apply to the
source code of this repository, which is licensed separately (see the
top-level LICENSE file, GPL-3.0). Third-party data with its own license
(e.g. electricity price data) lives under `data-external/` instead, each
with its own LICENSE file.

